{
    "title": "KRUU",
    "description": "Your celebration will be filled with many unforgettable moments and there will be moments that you will miss. The good thing is: your guests and the photographer will capture all the moments. Download the KRUU app so that none of these precious memories are lost. With the KRUU app, you can discover, download, comment on and like the best photos from your celebration. The photos from the KRUU Photo Booth are also automatically transferred to the app. And the best thing is: the app is free and there are no in-app purchases!\r\n\r\n\r\nTHIS IS WHAT THE KRUU APP OFFERS YOU:\r\nLarge online storage space - Upload your photos from the event and share them with your family & friends.\r\nOwn gallery - Discover the best moments of the party in a beautiful feed and interact with likes & comments.\r\nKRUU Photo Booth photos included - Your KRUU Photo Booth photos are automatically transferred to the KRUU.com app free of charge.\r\nClear guest list - Add your guests and invite them. The app allows you to keep track of acceptances and cancellations.\r\nShare the schedule in advance - Share the schedule with your guests so that everyone knows what to expect and where the party is taking place.\r\nEasily manage all participants in the admin area of the app and see exactly who you're sharing your unforgettable moments with.\r\n\r\nTHIS IS HOW IT WORKS:\r\nDownload the KRUU app and join an event or create a new one. Invite friends & family to the event. After the photo upload, you can like, comment and download the photos.\r\n\r\n\r\nWHY SHOULD YOU KEEP THE APP?\r\nYou want to download the photos again later and don't feel like searching through your entire mobile phone? No problem with our app!\r\nYou don't want to have the pictures in your personal photo album, but still want to browse through them from time to time? The pictures will be safely stored in the app for the next 3 months! Other guests can upload more cool pictures at any time.\r\nAlso use the app at future parties with a KRUU Photo Booth.\r\n\r\n\r\nPRIVACY POLICY\r\nOf course, the photos can only be viewed by you and your guests and are protected according to the highest GDPR standards in Germany. To ensure this, the photos are stored on German servers.\r\n\r\nWHO IS KRUU?\r\nOver 150,000 photo box customers have trusted us since 2016. We are Europe's market leader in the hire of photo boxes with around 50 employees in Bad Friedrichshall near Heilbronn (Baden-W\u00fcrttemberg).\r\nDo you have any questions or feedback?\r\nThen write to us at any time. We read all messages! support@kruu.com",
    "descriptionHTML": "Your celebration will be filled with many unforgettable moments and there will be moments that you will miss. The good thing is: your guests and the photographer will capture all the moments. Download the KRUU app so that none of these precious memories are lost. With the KRUU app, you can discover, download, comment on and like the best photos from your celebration. The photos from the KRUU Photo Booth are also automatically transferred to the app. And the best thing is: the app is free and there are no in-app purchases!<br><br><br>THIS IS WHAT THE KRUU APP OFFERS YOU:<br>Large online storage space - Upload your photos from the event and share them with your family &amp; friends.<br>Own gallery - Discover the best moments of the party in a beautiful feed and interact with likes &amp; comments.<br>KRUU Photo Booth photos included - Your KRUU Photo Booth photos are automatically transferred to the KRUU.com app free of charge.<br>Clear guest list - Add your guests and invite them. The app allows you to keep track of acceptances and cancellations.<br>Share the schedule in advance - Share the schedule with your guests so that everyone knows what to expect and where the party is taking place.<br>Easily manage all participants in the admin area of the app and see exactly who you&#39;re sharing your unforgettable moments with.<br><br>THIS IS HOW IT WORKS:<br>Download the KRUU app and join an event or create a new one. Invite friends &amp; family to the event. After the photo upload, you can like, comment and download the photos.<br><br><br>WHY SHOULD YOU KEEP THE APP?<br>You want to download the photos again later and don&#39;t feel like searching through your entire mobile phone? No problem with our app!<br>You don&#39;t want to have the pictures in your personal photo album, but still want to browse through them from time to time? The pictures will be safely stored in the app for the next 3 months! Other guests can upload more cool pictures at any time.<br>Also use the app at future parties with a KRUU Photo Booth.<br><br><br>PRIVACY POLICY<br>Of course, the photos can only be viewed by you and your guests and are protected according to the highest GDPR standards in Germany. To ensure this, the photos are stored on German servers.<br><br>WHO IS KRUU?<br>Over 150,000 photo box customers have trusted us since 2016. We are Europe&#39;s market leader in the hire of photo boxes with around 50 employees in Bad Friedrichshall near Heilbronn (Baden-W\u00fcrttemberg).<br>Do you have any questions or feedback?<br>Then write to us at any time. We read all messages! support@kruu.com",
